 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Start with a clean and tidy room, with lots of washing up and meals ready. A proper bed is the foundation of good guest room. A bowl of fruit and a bowl of nuts is fine, but keep the water to a glass each. More than that can get messy. A short note saying the password is on the fridge is fine. You could also say it's the same as yours at home, if you use the same one everywhere. A bouquet of fresh flowers looks lovely in glass vase. Just keep them from going limp in the room by watering them straight out of the shop and turning the vase occasionally.",
